            125,
            "Elite",
            "Coordinate (non-wildy)",
            "Bring ranged gear (Armadylean flies — CAN'T melee it!)",
            "Food",
            "Random spawn! Armadylean (ranged only, max 10) or Bandosian (melee, max 13). Bring a crossbow just in case.",
            false
